# Optional. By default the app downloads MediaPipe's WASM runtime from jsDelivr and
# the AI models from Google's model storage the first time it runs.
# Run `npm run setup:offline` to copy them into /public, then uncomment these lines
# to serve everything from your own site (works offline and behind strict firewalls).
# VITE_MEDIAPIPE_WASM=/mediapipe/wasm
# VITE_MODEL_BASE=/models
